    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own strategy with the dice</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/d3280167218ffedf2e738593c51b026b.poster.avif?t=1752124141\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/d3280167218ffedf2e738593c51b026b.webm?t=1752124141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/d3280167218ffedf2e738593c51b026b.mp4?t=1752124141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The dice is rolled!<br>Are you going to move? Are you going to act?<br>Different effects are applied to each die, and the numbers determine your behavior.<br>How do you combine numbers to get the best results?<br>Every time you pick a number, you'll have to choose carefully.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make a powerful board by strengthening the tiles.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/be3211b2a216f2c4a5b3a5c5df90bc65.poster.avif?t=1752124141\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/be3211b2a216f2c4a5b3a5c5df90bc65.webm?t=1752124141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/be3211b2a216f2c4a5b3a5c5df90bc65.mp4?t=1752124141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tiles get more and more powerful!<br>Every time you act on a tile, the tile gains experience, and the tile with enough experience is upgradeable.<br>Combine tiles with multiple properties to create the best strategy, your own board<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat the monsters and bosses</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/97b5ec51a539d95950b32125aad15674.poster.avif?t=1752124141\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/97b5ec51a539d95950b32125aad15674.webm?t=1752124141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/97b5ec51a539d95950b32125aad15674.mp4?t=1752124141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Monsters disturb you!<br>Monsters can summon Fireballs, or they can curse and cause obstacles to certain tiles.<br>You have to move and act with the dice, avoiding these patterns every time.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own strategy with the dice</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/d3280167218ffedf2e738593c51b026b.poster.avif?t=1752124141\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/d3280167218ffedf2e738593c51b026b.webm?t=1752124141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/d3280167218ffedf2e738593c51b026b.mp4?t=1752124141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The dice is rolled!<br>Are you going to move? Are you going to act?<br>Different effects are applied to each die, and the numbers determine your behavior.<br>How do you combine numbers to get the best results?<br>Every time you pick a number, you'll have to choose carefully.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make a powerful board by strengthening the tiles.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/be3211b2a216f2c4a5b3a5c5df90bc65.poster.avif?t=1752124141\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/be3211b2a216f2c4a5b3a5c5df90bc65.webm?t=1752124141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/be3211b2a216f2c4a5b3a5c5df90bc65.mp4?t=1752124141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tiles get more and more powerful!<br>Every time you act on a tile, the tile gains experience, and the tile with enough experience is upgradeable.<br>Combine tiles with multiple properties to create the best strategy, your own board<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat the monsters and bosses</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/97b5ec51a539d95950b32125aad15674.poster.avif?t=1752124141\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/97b5ec51a539d95950b32125aad15674.webm?t=1752124141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735620/extras/97b5ec51a539d95950b32125aad15674.mp4?t=1752124141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Monsters disturb you!<br>Monsters can summon Fireballs, or they can curse and cause obstacles to certain tiles.<br>You have to move and act with the dice, avoiding these patterns every time.",
